DE:
{{TAG:0003:001F:}}Raus mit dem Bösen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Rein mit dem Glück!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hihi...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hee hee.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Throwing my own beans
really makes it feel like {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bean Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Thanks for helping,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bad ogre!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pas de jour du haricot digne de ce
nom sans un bon lancer de haricots !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Merci, cher ogre maléfique, hi hi !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ih ih ih!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non è un vero Setsubun
se non si possono tirare i fagioli.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Merci, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}mio galante spirito malvagio!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hihihi, ich liebe den {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bohnentag{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hauptsächlich, weil ich so gerne mit
Bohnen werfe.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Danke, böser Oger!

{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ohne Bohnen kein {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bohnentag{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Oh, äh, ich habe dich da doch nicht
gerade ins Auge getroffen, oder?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Quoi ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Un ogre avec des haricots ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ce sont des vrais ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Je suis quand
même censée te lancer les miens ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}C'est plus le jour du haricot, c'est
le jour des questions ! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Et pour ça,
je manque un peu d'entraînement...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bu da ne? Oni{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} olmuşsun ama {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
fasulye atmak mı istiyorsun?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Aa{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
! Gerçekten eğlenceli tabii. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Onilerin de hoşuna
gidebileceğini hiç düşünmemiştim!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Really?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} An ogre carrying beans?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}I've
never met an ogre who does that.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You must be very avant-garde.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}C'est très bizarre!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Uno spirito
malvagio con dei fagioli in mano?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Come sei {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}avant-garde!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Gerçekten{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} mi? Fasulye taşıyan {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
bir{{TAG:0003:0025:}} oni? Böyle bir oniyle hiç
karşılaşmamıştım{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}. Oldukça sıra dışısın.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Aujourd'hui, jour du haricot !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Prépares-en un bon stock, tu en
auras besoin si tu croises un ogre !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi sono riempita le tasche di fagioli,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
nel caso mi dovessi imbattere
in uno spirito malvagio.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugünün Setsubun olduğunu{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
unutma{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}! Hiç fasulye atmazsan
bütün yıl şanssız geçebilir!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh! Vedo che hai portato i fagioli
con te.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Con quelli che mi avanzano{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
preparerò una zuppa squisitissima.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tu participes au jour du haricot ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
C'est gentil de suivre nos traditions,
amuse-toi bien !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Vedo che ci siamo ben attrezzat{{TAG:000E:0006:0200690002006500}}
per questo Setsubun!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} Avremo
sicuramente un anno fortunato!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Merhaba{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}, sevgili fasulye dostum{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
! Güzel kasabamızdaki kötü
şansı kovmaya hazır mısın?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Zu Gästen bin ich niemals unhöflich.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du kannst also hierbleiben.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Aber nachher machen wir draußen
mit dem Bohnenwerfen weiter.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Keine Müdigkeit vortäuschen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Evime misafir olarak {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}geldin;
seni kovmak kabalık olur. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Fasulye geleneğimize dışarı
çıkınca devam ederiz.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I suppose it wouldn't be {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Bean Day{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
without you ogres.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Rest here for a
few minutes.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Then it's back outside!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Sanırım siz oniler {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}olmasanız {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
Setsubun da olmazdı{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}. Birkaç
dakika dinlen; {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}sonra yeniden dışarı!
